<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1885183363"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1587668503"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夏霞 - From THE FIRST TAKE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="あたらよ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="夏霞 - From THE FIRST TAKE"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:36.616"><div begin="00:01.149" end="03:36.616"><p begin="00:01.149" end="00:08.475" itunes:key="L44938">今更 思い出すなよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今 就别再回想起来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra o mo i da su na yo</span></p><p begin="00:11.676" end="00:20.958" itunes:key="L44939">空の青さに目を奪われて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被湛蓝的天空 夺走了所有的视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no a o sa ni me wo u ba wa re te</span></p><p begin="00:20.968" end="00:29.796" itunes:key="L44940">足元の花に気付けないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍未察觉到在脚边盛开的鲜花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi mo to no ha na ni ki zu ke na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:30.593" end="00:40.165" itunes:key="L44941">懐かしい風が頬を掠めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人怀念的清风拂过脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi i ka ze ga ho ho wo ka su me te</span></p><p begin="00:40.175" end="00:49.106" itunes:key="L44942">君の香りを今も想ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的香味 现在仍萦绕在我鼻尖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ka o ri wo i ma mo o mo 't te ru</span></p><p begin="00:49.116" end="00:54.571" itunes:key="L44943">ねぇ 今更になって思い出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 事到如今才回想起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne i ma sa ra ni na 't te o mo i da su</span></p><p begin="00:54.581" end="00:59.356" itunes:key="L44944">色のない世界残る香りに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残留在暗淡无光的世界的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro no na i se ka i no ko ru ka o ri ni</span></p><p begin="00:59.366" end="01:06.852" itunes:key="L44945">後悔ばかりが募ってゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有悔意不断堆积</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u ka i ba ka ri ga tsu no 't te yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:07.897" end="01:12.766" itunes:key="L44946">忘れられないと泣くくらいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要痛哭悔过 不愿忘怀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i to na ku ku ra i na ra</span></p><p begin="01:12.776" end="01:17.427" itunes:key="L44947">ただ僕らを包めよ夏霞<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿盛夏霞光包围你我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da bo ku ra wo tsu tsu me yo na tsu ga su mi</span></p><p begin="01:17.437" end="01:20.507" itunes:key="L44948">さよならが痛いのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中早已明了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra ga i ta i no wa</span></p><p begin="01:20.517" end="01:26.952" itunes:key="L44949">苦しいほど知ってるのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离别会有多么苦痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru shi i ho do shi 't te ru no ni</span></p><p begin="01:27.014" end="01:31.706" itunes:key="L44950">あの儚く散る花火の下で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我仍在那绚丽四散的烟花下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha ka na ku chi ru ha na bi no shi ta de</span></p><p begin="01:31.716" end="01:36.670" itunes:key="L44951">馬鹿みたいに永遠を誓った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像个傻瓜一样 誓下永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ka mi ta i ni e i e n wo chi ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:36.680" end="01:44.953" itunes:key="L44952">今更、 思い出すなよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今 就别再回想起来了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra o mo i da su na yo</span></p><p begin="02:01.046" end="02:07.482" itunes:key="L44953">あの夜君が（君が）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 我终于懂得</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no yo ru ki mi ga bo ku ni ko bo shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:05.719" end="02:12.210" itunes:key="L44954">僕に零した（零した）</p><p begin="02:10.348" end="02:17.125" itunes:key="L44955">痛みの意味も（意味も）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那夜你向我诉说的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi no i mi mo i ma na ra wa ka ru</span></p><p begin="02:15.130" end="02:17.983" itunes:key="L44956">今なら分かる</p><p begin="02:17.983" end="02:20.235" itunes:key="L44957">気がするんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">痛楚的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ga su ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:20.576" end="02:26.373" itunes:key="L44958">Uh</p><p begin="02:26.383" end="02:29.001" itunes:key="L44959">Oh, yeah</p><p begin="02:29.001" end="02:31.276" itunes:key="L44960">きっと今なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今 定已明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to i ma na ra</span></p><p begin="02:31.286" end="02:33.426" itunes:key="L44961">きっと今なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今 定已明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to i ma na ra</span></p><p begin="02:33.436" end="02:38.306" itunes:key="L44962">僕らは そう願った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们 曾如此祈愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa so u ne ga 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:38.316" end="02:42.957" itunes:key="L44963">思い出せないと泣くくらいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要痛哭悔过 无法忆起曾经</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da se na i to na ku ku ra i na ra</span></p><p begin="02:42.967" end="02:47.680" itunes:key="L44964">ただ僕らを包めよ夏霞<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿盛夏霞光包围你我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da bo ku ra wo tsu tsu me yo na tsu ga su mi</span></p><p begin="02:47.690" end="02:52.528" itunes:key="L44965">さよならが痛いのは知っていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中已明了离别会有多么苦痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra ga i ta i no wa shi 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:52.538" end="02:57.218" itunes:key="L44966">それでも僕らは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管如此 你我二人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo bo ku ra wa</span></p><p begin="02:57.228" end="03:02.006" itunes:key="L44967">あの儚く散る花火の下で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍在那绚丽四散的烟花下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha ka na ku chi ru ha na bi no shi ta de</span></p><p begin="03:02.016" end="03:06.765" itunes:key="L44968">馬鹿みたいに永遠を誓った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像个傻瓜一样 誓下永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ka mi ta i ni e i e n wo chi ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:07.001" end="03:21.764" itunes:key="L44969">その日々さえ愛おしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深爱着那日日时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi bi sa e i to o shi i</span></p><p begin="03:22.162" end="03:29.515" itunes:key="L44970">愛おしい 愛おしい日々<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好 满怀爱意的日夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to o shi i i to o shi i hi bi</span></p><p begin="03:30.752" end="03:36.616" itunes:key="L44971">また僕ら色付く日々に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们再次重回那绚烂的日夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta bo ku ra i ro zu ku hi bi ni</span></p></div></body></tt>